      "notes": "Model length (z, 1.0 unit) runs from the bowsprit tip to the stern: 92 m overall (301 ft). The red bottom (antifouling) is about 8% of the length, and she floats light: in the 2012 photo (3-context.jpg) the upper part of the red shows, so the waterline is 4.5 m above the model's lowest point (2026-10-18). Her bow points toward the pier's shore end, by the Eureka (the same photo; about.md's 'north-west' is wrong). Two LODs only: the simplifier stops at ~8 k triangles whatever the error limit (the rigging is hundreds of separate textured strips with UV seams), and most of the memory is the texture; beyond lod1's range a game draws its own stand-in (cityengine: the procedural ship).",
